  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_6fb70291d58f42d09aaafc8e3a26d310",
      "statement": "Setting ROSA_TA_AUTH=disabled swaps in MockMiddleware/MockAuthzMiddleware, granting every caller a hardcoded dev-user identity with the SREP role and skipping OCM/AMS network calls, and the server refuses to start with ROSA_TA_AUTH=disabled unless ROSA_TA_KUBECONFIG is also set.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://integration/README.md#L11-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d9c796fc34b22451d25f15a2e579d72b1d95eae77ecafbf5c6c173d05ea6da8a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d85d091a1a754d75a64b1e4c916ee6df",
      "statement": "With ROSA_TA_AUTH=disabled the server also requires ROSA_TA_AWS_ENDPOINT_URL to be set, because mock auth hands every caller the SREP role and the AWS SDK's default credential chain would otherwise pick up ambient host/pod credentials.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://integration/README.md#L22-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a927c22e3c1f580a1702d46cad809c1e6bd090536f1d984e3c462d25ce17311e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_82d39712236240808081b90adb0354b4",
      "statement": "integration/itest-up.sh creates or reuses a disposable kind cluster (image kindest/node:v1.33.1, name from ROSA_TA_KIND_CLUSTER_NAME default rosa-ta), starts the LocalStack community image via podman-compose, waits for both to report healthy, applies pull-secret and prometheus fixtures, and waits for at least two Prometheus alerts to fire before returning.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://integration/itest-up.sh#L1-L93",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:36207b7649ddadb19ac9218828520c92be9b4f90bbb73bb5f60d98f540237551:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f9163fb3bb8544438517aa4da99f144d",
      "statement": "integration/itest-run.sh retrieves a kubeconfig from the kind cluster, exports ROSA_TA_AUTH=disabled, ROSA_TA_KUBECONFIG, DATABASE_URL, and AWS variables including ROSA_TA_AWS_ENDPOINT_URL pointed at LocalStack and ROSA_TA_AWS_ALLOWED_REGIONS (which has no built-in default), builds and starts the server binary, and waits for /health before running smoke tests.",
      "evidence": [
