    {
      "id": "claim_bd2b072e33d648c09463cc444e28b3b4",
      "statement": "Five aws-get resources (load-balancers, load-balancers-classic, target-groups, target-health, cloudtrail-events) require LocalStack Pro (elb, elbv2, cloudtrail services) and are not exercised by itest-run.sh against the community LocalStack image; they are covered only by unit tests against fakes in internal/actions, so a green itest-run run is not evidence this part of the AWS read surface works against a real API implementation.",
